 "De Passau a Viena siguiendo el río, casi sin cuestas": "From Passau to Vienna along the river, with hardly any hills",
 "<div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;color:#c6f432;line-height:1\">330</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;color:#8a96a8;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:6px\">KM EN TOTAL</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;color:#c6f432;line-height:1\">330</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;color:#8a96a8;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:6px\">KM IN TOTAL</div>",
 "<div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:52px;font-weight:700;color:#38bdf8;line-height:1\">6</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;color:#8a96a8;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:6px\">ETAPAS</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:52px;font-weight:700;color:#38bdf8;line-height:1\">6</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;color:#8a96a8;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:6px\">STAGES</div>",
 "<div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:52px;font-weight:700;color:#ff9f43;line-height:1\">55</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;color:#8a96a8;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:6px\">KM DE MEDIA</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:52px;font-weight:700;color:#ff9f43;line-height:1\">55</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;color:#8a96a8;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:6px\">KM ON AVERAGE</div>",
