 "<b style=\"color:#38bdf8\">Waypoint</b><br><span style=\"color:#8a96a8\">Un sitio con nombre: salida, fuente, taller.</span>": "<b style=\"color:#38bdf8\">Waypoint</b><br><span style=\"color:#8a96a8\">A named place: start, fountain, bike shop.</span>",
 "<b style=\"color:#ff9f43\">Track</b><br><span style=\"color:#8a96a8\">El camino, punto a punto, con altura.</span>": "<b style=\"color:#ff9f43\">Track</b><br><span style=\"color:#8a96a8\">The path, point by point, with elevation.</span>",
 "<b style=\"color:#e8edf3\">Cierre</b><br><span style=\"color:#8a96a8\">Y listo para cualquier app.</span>": "<b style=\"color:#e8edf3\">Closing</b><br><span style=\"color:#8a96a8\">And ready for any app.</span>",
